@startuml 洪水冲击吞吐时序
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 静默链路 vs 洪水链路:同一文件的传输时间线对比

participant "发送端" as T
participant "串口链路\n(115200 bps)" as L

== 场景一:静默链路 (基线) ==

T -> L  : 子包 #1 (44ms)
T -> L  : 子包 #2 (44ms)
T -> L  : 子包 #3 ...
note over T, L
  无噪声: 子包背靠背流动,
  吞吐 ≈ 线速的 90%+
end note

== 场景二:洪水链路 (污染) ==

T -> L  : 子包 #1
L --> T : ZRPOS(#1)  ← 子包 #1 被污染
T -> L  : 子包 #1 重发
T -> L  : 子包 #2
L --> T : ZRPOS(#2)  ← 子包 #2 被污染
T -> L  : 子包 #2 重发
T -> L  : 子包 #3
L --> T : ZRPOS(#3)  ← 子包 #3 又被污染
T -> L  : 子包 #3 重发
note over T, L
  每个 ZRPOS 往返引入
  节流等待 + 重传 + 对齐开销,
  有效吞吐可能跌至 1/3 以下;
  极端时重试烧穿 MAX_CRC_RETRIES
  直接失败
end note

@enduml
